          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "spirit",
            text: _("Well done! Who else but Dacyn the Magnificent could have defeated such a rival? You truly are the greatest of heroes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "spirit2",
            text: _("Now, embrace our power! You shall live on as the champion of Irdya!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Wha— where am I? What’s happening to me?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "spirit",
            text: _("The mage called Dacyn is dying! It is time for you to be reborn under a new name: Mal-Dak‘an."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("—I... —I am no necromancer! Everything I have done is for the good of Wesnoth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "spirit",
            text: _("Was it? Was it for the good of all Wesnoth when you took Iliah-Malal’s Amulet of the Veil, turning to the darkness and letting us into your soul?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "spirit",
            text: _("Was it for the good of Wesnoth when you enslaved the seer Eryssa’s senile mind, so the King would choose you as his advisor over Ravan?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I... I needed that power! I was the only one who could be trusted to safeguard Irdya!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "spirit",
            text: _("And now you can, for all eternity! Leave your mortal coil behind. Live on as an undying spirit of mighty power, and do unto this world as you will!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I... but... I could never choose to—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "wail.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "spirit",
            text: _("You misunderstand. This is no choice of yours. The stone bleeds your flesh. The darkness consumes your soul. Rebirth into undeath is the only path forward to escape the Maw, else ye embrace oblivion."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Dacyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.name",
                value: "Mal-Dak’an",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Dacyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.name",
                value: "Dacyn",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("No."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("No. For too long, I have allowed my pride to overrule my wisdom. I have been arrogant. I have been the fool in this story. I believed I and only I was destined for greatness. But I can see it clearly now. I have been no different than my dear friend Ravan. We have been the same all along."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("But no longer. My will is my own."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I will not be tempted by undeath. I will pass unto the Land of the Dead, and if I am to be damned there then so be it."),
